    Bug 2018246 - Add dialogs and logic to allow suppressing Experiments. r=aleca, sol, mkmelin, freaktechnik

    This is patch is adding logic which is only activated if the preference
    `extensions.experiments.suppressed` is set to `true`. Enabling it will

     * prevent users from installing Experiment add-ons (see [1] for an example)
     * installed Experiments will be blocked and app-disabled
     * blocked Experiments will get a warning banner with a link to learn more
       and find alternative add-ons

    [1]: https://addons.thunderbird.net/thunderbird/downloads/file/1041596/dkim_verifier-6.2.0-tb.xpi

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D284292

